# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [alpha_ti].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Source: COD 9008517; Wyckoff, Crystal Structures 1, 7 (1963) (P 63/m m c, a = 2.95 A, c = 4.686 A).
# Symmetry-equivalent sites expanded to P1 with gemmi.
